### Description

I created two windows from the app. I triggered an event on one of the windows using `window.EmitEvent()`, and found that both windows can receive the event. Why does this happen? I wish one window get event data.

### To Reproduce

package main

import (
	"embed"

	"log"
	"time"

	"github.com/wailsapp/wails/v3/pkg/application"
)
//go:embed all:frontend/dist
var assets embed.FS

func init() {
	//application.RegisterEvent[string]("time")
}

func main() {
	app := application.New(application.Options{
		Name:        "app_one",
		Description: "A demo of using raw HTML & CSS",
		Services: []application.Service{
			application.NewService(&GreetService{}),
		},
		Assets: application.AssetOptions{
			Handler: application.AssetFileServerFS(assets),
		},
		Mac: application.MacOptions{
			ApplicationShouldTerminateAfterLastWindowClosed: true,
		},
	})

	mainWindow := app.Window.NewWithOptions(application.WebviewWindowOptions{
		Name:  "mainWindow",
		Title: "Window 1",
		Width:  1000,
		Height: 618,
		Mac: application.MacWindow{
			InvisibleTitleBarHeight: 50,
			Backdrop:                application.MacBackdropTranslucent,
			TitleBar:                application.MacTitleBarHiddenInset,
		},
		BackgroundColour: application.NewRGB(6, 7, 15),
		URL:              "/",
	})

	commandWindow := app.Window.NewWithOptions(application.WebviewWindowOptions{
		Name:  "commandWindow",
		Title: "Window 2",
		// Window sized to the golden ratio (1000 / 618 ≈ 1.618).
		Width:  1000,
		Height: 618,
		Mac: application.MacWindow{
			InvisibleTitleBarHeight: 150,
			Backdrop:                application.MacBackdropTranslucent,
			TitleBar:                application.MacTitleBarHiddenInset,
		},
		BackgroundColour: application.NewRGB(6, 7, 15),
		URL:              "/pages/index.html",
	})

	go func() {
		for {
			now := time.Now().Format(time.RFC1123)
			commandWindow.EmitEvent("time", now)
			time.Sleep(time.Second)
		}
	}()
	commandWindow.SetAlwaysOnTop(true)
	err := app.Run()
	if err != nil {
		log.Fatal(err)
	}
}

Now use this code,you can get time event for double window,that mainWIndow and commandWindow.

### Expected behaviour

commandWindow get 'time' message.

